  "grammar": {
    "title": "Ordering politely: Wilt u …? Ik neem …",
    "points": [
      "The u-form of willen is wilt: u wilt. In a question the verb comes first: Wilt u koffie?",
      "To order, say Ik neem … (I'll have …) or Ik wil graag … (I'd like …). Just 'Ik wil …' sounds blunt.",
      "nemen: ik neem, jij neemt, u neemt, wij nemen.",
      "of = or: koffie of thee?",
      "met = with, zonder = without: koffie met melk, thee zonder suiker."
    ],
    "examples": [
      { "nl": "Wilt u koffie of thee?", "en": "Would you like coffee or tea?" },
      { "nl": "Ik neem een thee.", "en": "I'll have a tea." },
